<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Blood Death Knights</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. World Bosses, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>, will offer raid-equivalent loot and will serve as this expansion's <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> equivalent.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-celestial-court">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pet_tigergodcub.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Celestial Court</span></h3>Chi-ji, Yu'Lon, Xuen, and Niuzao all share a loot pool and drop item level 553 Tier 16.<br/>
<br/>Make sure to have Blood as loot spec when killing these bosses, as tank tier is very valuable for Blood Death Knights, but if you accidentally find yourself getting the DPS tier, it will still be better than pretty much anything else you can get before stepping into raid.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99189/handguards-of-cyclopean-dread">
<img alt="Handguards of Cyclopean Dread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of Cyclopean Dread</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=99191/legguards-of-cyclopean-dread">
<img alt="Legguards of Cyclopean Dread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Cyclopean Dread</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="ordos">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_axe_1h_firelandsraid_d_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Ordos, Fire God of the Yaungol</span></h3>Ordos drops some decent pieces, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105766/anafielles-spiked-choker">
<img alt="Anafielle's Spiked Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anafielle's Spiked Choker</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105769/omegals-crushing-carapace">
<img alt="Omegal's Crushing Carapace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Omegal's Crushing Carapace</span></a>. These are fairly rare, but can be nice items until you step into raid, as they are equivalent to Normal difficulty items.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105766/anafielles-spiked-choker">
<img alt="Anafielle's Spiked Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_key_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anafielle's Spiked Choker</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105765/bladeforger-necklace">
<img alt="Bladeforger Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklace_mop1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bladeforger Necklace</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=105805/dominiks-casque-of-raging-flame">
<img alt="Dominik's Casque of Raging Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_plate_raiddeathknight_n_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dominik's Casque of Raging Flame</span></a></div></li>
<li>
