<img alt="Belt of the Tyrannotitan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tyrannotitan</span></a></div></li>
