<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95152/breastplate-of-the-iguanocolossus">
<img alt="Breastplate of the Iguanocolossus" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the Iguanocolossus</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95153/tyrant-king-battleplate">
<img alt="Tyrant King Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrant King Battleplate</span></a></div></li>
