<img alt="Timeless Coin" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/timelesscoin.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Timeless Coin</span></span></a></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=103982/burden-of-eternity">
<img alt="Burden of Eternity" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_monk_envelopingmist.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burden of Eternity</span></a></td>
